{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1408e5acea661fdc16d4477b2ac133f3780c9f940eb3cc3674a0e322e3f3211d","ja":"お姫さまの休日","zh":"公主的假日","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f8ce6a39532f2a18178f2bebc17009d3c9a7cc72f45b76099d7bf2f45700f6ad","ja":"そして、ふたりのプライベート動画撮影当日……","zh":"然后，到了两人私人视频拍摄的当天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5fefb15c9de05c32fed3b735ac9dd00ec5691b6391af8a980aa0a28056d113b9","ja":"やっほ～！　たまきだぞ！　今日はまつりのお姫さまな\nお休みを撮影してもらうことになったんだ！","zh":"呀吼～！我是环哦！今天我们来拍摄\n茉莉像公主一样的假日生活了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0cb0d9cec6d91cdebe8c337325c79fd3adbb91274fed14ad37dc06f9d4001d00","ja":"ねえねえ、馬車はどこにあるの？\nまつり、お休みの日は馬車に乗ってるんだよね？","zh":"呐呐，马车在哪里呀？\n茉莉休息天都是坐马车的，对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d009df4924c3382d670b54efef27a50c90077c5c33d5b4d397eea223089209e1","ja":"はいなのです♪　ですが今日は残念ながら、\nお馬さんたちがお休みの日だったのです……。","zh":"是的♪不过很遗憾，今天\n小马们都休息了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c46cace45af210b6ceeb6d4b86b8a4db3f19c7e024a411232a6bc864b6d6cc9c","ja":"そっか～！\nお馬さんもお休みしないといけないもんね？","zh":"这样啊～！\n小马也是需要休息的对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d7e6566fe7e4d72d8cbbc07c8536571f1dd0b88c0df123c179aff4c3461b35dd","ja":"なので、今日はプラン変更なのです♪\nいいですか？","zh":"所以，今天就变更计划吧♪\n可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5571a3340203d7e1eb12e0318c288d266992cccede222241a8b79c93da333ae6","ja":"うん！　それで、どこに行くの？","zh":"嗯！那么，要去哪里呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ee43ebeb53076c5f2a33312eca4c5aebce4a4743edcafba3a03a1221fcbeb9e2","ja":"わぁ～っ！　ここが、まつりが前に言ってた\n『ぷらいべーとがーでん』なの？","zh":"哇～！这里就是茉莉之前说过的\n“秘密花园”吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"997daa4b29adda43d0411fa0a795c333c887b7d6abc1316d4ed48b7b8759bf78","ja":"ちょっと違うのです。今日は姫お気に入りの庭園\nカフェに、環ちゃんを案内してあげたかったのですよ。","zh":"不是那样的哦。今天公主本来是想带\n环去自己心仪的花园咖啡厅的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e71e4182bad692fd69b2184190487e2844e1846c81cc0d21cc097cd80a534507","ja":"そうなんだ！　じゃあ『ぷらいべーとがーでん』は、\nまた今度、連れてってね！","zh":"这样啊！那下次一定要带我去\n“秘密花园”哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053","ja":"はいなのです！","zh":"好的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"96a81770d3ede3066d6e24dce33b0ef4b1e29771a5e8d09d7882288f4365014a","ja":"では環ちゃん。さっそく\nアフタヌーンティーを楽しみましょう♪","zh":"那么小环，我们这就来\n享受下午茶时光吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"84b8c169420cf2fb34ae39dcd1c3ad269ab7dca7807a66b65ddd85759066ad64","ja":"チリンチリン♪","zh":"叮铃叮铃♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"71198b22059f05428748e823519ba79d499aebcfb48307003c52cd425cfe7c30","ja":"わっ！？　サンドイッチとか、ケーキとか……\nお皿がいっぱいだぞ～！","zh":"哇！？有三明治，还有蛋糕……\n盘子好多啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b6a42e53e13a36d9ba17d6ed4ebc4aed4ab6c6c623136c71e5469ac2303c2262","ja":"アフタヌーンティーのデザートなのです。\nさあ環ちゃん、召し上がれ♪","zh":"这是下午茶的甜点哦。\n来，小环，请用吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"1dd224deee7704a31767d0039c75cf793987d28fb0e29097852e6a00f0d73a23","ja":"うんっ……！","zh":"嗯……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1054.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"27469d96d2e2c03b940eb841a15f56f9a4137dd2654dbd9ded4aa197a98b7d8c","ja":"わあっ～、すっごくおいしい！\nお姫さまのおやつって、おいしいんだね♪","zh":"哇～，超级好吃！\n公主的点心，原来这么美味呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
